{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01JNaNj65khAd5PyszgJkdVk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0147v2QZfeCS4bT2tr9z96Xq","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kavi/Documents/Claude/Projects/AI投資委員會/reports/decision_review/REVIEW_2026-06-20.md","content":"# Weekly Review — 2026-06-20\n\n_event_index_at: 2026-06-20T13:42:17_\n_decisions_analyzed: 339 (deep-dive 143 / news-digest 57 / sector-scan 52 / thematic-screener 50 / momentum-screen 24 / theme-detector 5 / short-term-weekly 4 / postmortem 3 / earnings-analyzer 1)_\n\n> **Cadence note**: 上次 REVIEW 為 2026-06-14（+6 日）。新增資料僅 3 筆 06-14 後 deep-dive\n> （ARM miss / ORCL hit / TSM pending），全 SIDEWAYS regime。多數 carry-over metric 與\n> 06-14 持平；judgement 以「持平」記。本週 4 個 active TODO 觸 `review_count ≥ 4` → 標 **[stale]**。\n\n> Carry-over READY 項目見 Section 5 末尾。\n\n## 0. Carry-over from Previous REVIEWs\n\n| TODO-ID | title | source_type | review_count | judgement | evidence this week |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| TODO-003 | momentum-screen verdict 規則重審 | accumulating_data | **4 [stale]** | still_waiting | n=24（持平無新 run）4H/8M/12neu = hit 17%/miss 33%/neu 50%。樣本 4 週不長 → 建議 drop 或改「以 N=24 直接評」 |\n| TODO-004 | 拆 final_decision + final_action 兩欄 | out_of_scope | **4 [stale]** | still_waiting | final_action null 2.1% (3/143)，modifier 4 週乾淨分離 → **建議 drop**（輕量欄已足） |\n| TODO-006 | pre-V5 macro_regime null | instrumentation_gap | **4 [stale]** | still_waiting | deep-dive macro_regime null 23.1% (33/143)，4 週無回推需求 → **建議 drop/休眠**（待跨年比較才回填） |\n| TODO-007 | Rec 7 heat asymmetry 連 3 週 <15pp → paused | accumulating_data | **4 [stale]** | continue | gap **24pp**（top30 50% 44/88 vs not30 26% 10/38）≥15pp → asymmetry 維持，Rec 7 不 paused。建議轉常設 tripwire（見 §3） |\n| TODO-009 | News-decisive deep-dive miss 偏高 | accumulating_data | 3 | still_waiting | News-decisive N=31（<40 門檻）miss 56% (15/27 eval)；拆：News-conserv 11/16=69% vs News-active 4/11=36% → 高 miss 主來自保守決策（與 Pattern